H2105.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah(?) living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:20; 
son of: Ishi (H3469H); 
brother of: Ben-zoheth (H1132) 
§ Zoheth = "releasing"
a son of Ishi of the tribe of Judah

H2117.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:33; 
son of: Jonathan (H3129); 
brother of: Peleth (H6431H) 
§ Zaza = "brightness" or "fulness"
one of the sons of Jonathan, descendant of Jerahmeel

H2124H.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 2 Chroniques 11:20; 
son of: Rehoboam (H7346) and Maacah (H4601K); 
brother of: Abijah (H0029I), Attai (H6262I) and Shelomith (H8019); 
half-brother of: Jeush (H3266K), Shemariah (H8114H) and Zaham (H2093)
§ Ziza = "shining"
1) son of Shiphi, a chief of the Simeonites in the reign of Hezekiah
2) son of Rehoboam by Maachah the granddaughter of Absalom

H2125.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 23:10; 
son of: Shimei (H8096G); 
brother of: Jahath (H3189I), Jeush (H3266J) and Beriah (H1283J); also called Zina at 1 Chroniques 23:10; 
Another name of zi.na (זִינָא "Zina" H2126) 
§ Zizah = "abundance"
a Gershonite Levite, second son of Shimei; also called 'Zina'

H2127.def:
A man of the tribe of Gad living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 5:13; 
son of: Abihail (H0032I); 
brother of: Michael (H4317H), Meshullam (H4918I), Sheba (H7652), Jorai (H3140), Jacan (H3275) and Eber (H5677H) 
§ Zia = "tumult"
one of the Gadites who dwelt in Bashan

H2129.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:16; 
son of: Jehallelel (H3094); 
brother of: Ziph (H2128J), Tiria (H8493) and Asarel (H0840) 
§ Ziphah = "battlement"
a son of Jehaleleel, a descendant of Judah, and brother of Ziph

H2133.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:10; 
son of: Bilhan (H1092H); 
brother of: Jeush (H3266H), Benjamin (H1144H), Ehud (H0164H), Chenaanah (H3668H), Tarshish (H8659I) and Ahishahar (H0300) 
§ Zethan = "olive"
a Benjamite of the sons of Bilhan

H2144.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:31; 
son of: Abiel (H0022) and Maacah (H4601N); 
brother of: Kish (H7027), Ner (H5369), Abdon (H5658J), Zur (H6698I), Baal (H1168B), Nadab (H5070J), Gedor (H1446I), Ahio (H0283I) and Mikloth (H4732); also called Zechariah at 1 Chroniques 9:37; 
Also named: ze.khar.yah (זְכַרְיָהוּ "Zechariah" H2148x) 
§ Zacher = "remembrance"
a Gibeonite

H2148F.def:
A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 26:11; 
son of: Hosah (H2621H); 
brother of: Shimri (H8113I), Hilkiah (H2518J) and Tebaliah (H2882)
§ Zechariah = "Jehovah remembers"
11th in order of the minor prophets; a priest, son of Berechiah and grandson of Iddo, who, along with Haggai, directed the rebuilding of the temple in the days of Zerubbabel

